時，公卿皆武力有功之臣。孝文時頗徵用，然孝文帝本好刑名之言。及至孝景，不任儒者，而竇太后又好黃老之術，故諸博士具官待問，未有進者。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m004-0001","start":1,"end":4,"surface":"高皇帝","kind":"person","person_id":"x85_w53_dyq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m004-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"項籍","kind":"person","person_id":"mtg_mtp_8oz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m004-0013","start":13,"end":17,"surface":"魯中諸儒","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m004-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"聖人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m004-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"t0d_uf0_f2f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m004-0124","start":124,"end":127,"surface":"叔孫通","kind":"person","person_id":"o57_ilh_v3i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m004-0137","start":137,"end":141,"surface":"諸生弟子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m004-0180","start":180,"end":182,"surface":"孝惠","kind":"person","person_id":"f2v_ue2_c9t","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m004-0183","start":183,"end":185,"surface":"呂后","kind":"person","person_id":"neq_81h_l49","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m004-0187","start":187,"end":189,"surface":"公卿","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m004-0197","start":197,"end":199,"surface":"孝文","kind":"person","person_id":"vz8_68e_j99","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m004-0205","start":205,"end":208,"surface":"孝文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"vz8_68e_j99","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m004-0217","start":217,"end":219,"surface":"孝景","kind":"person","person_id":"8s8_8m3_upb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m004-0226","start":226,"end":229,"surface":"竇太后","kind":"person","person_id":"r4k_my1_3w5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m004-0237","start":237,"end":240,"surface":"諸博士","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-121-rulin","book_id":"b-shiji-121","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji121-rulin"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:p008","text":"蘭陵王臧既受詩，以事孝景帝為太子少傅，免去。今上初即位，臧乃上書宿衛上，累遷，一歲中為郎中令。及代趙綰亦嘗受詩申公，綰為御史大夫。綰、臧請天子，欲立明堂以朝諸侯，不能就其事，乃言師申公。於是天子使使束帛加璧安車駟馬迎申公，弟子二人乘軺傳從。至，見天子。天子問治亂之事，申公時已八十餘，老，對曰：「為治者不在多言，顧力行何如耳。」是時天子方好文詞，見申公對，默然。然已招致，則以為太中大夫，舍魯邸，議明堂事。太皇竇太后好老子言，不說儒術，得趙綰、王臧之過以讓上，上因廢明堂事，盡下趙綰、王臧吏，後皆自殺。申公亦疾免以歸，數年卒。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m008-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"王臧","kind":"person","person_id":"fhl_wxh_rfr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m008-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"孝景帝","kind":"person","person_id":"8s8_8m3_upb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m008-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"今上","kind":"person","person_id":"o7s_89o_zka","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m008-0028","start":28,"end":29,"surface":"臧","kind":"person","person_id":"fhl_wxh_rfr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m008-0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"o7s_89o_zka","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m008-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"趙綰","kind":"person","person_id":"8dt_22t_v15","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m008-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"申公","kind":"person","person_id":"wxo_k8i_1it","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m008-0058","start":58,"end":59,"surface":"綰","kind":"person","person_id":"8dt_22t_v15","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-ruli